4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! Let's make this place super clean! I want to see how other people do it, so I'll check the visit to the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, let's make it a pleasant space for everyone. I'm curious about the costs, so I'll look into the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're aiming for a solution that actually lasts, I'll check the ward complaint log for this point and the statements at the residents' meeting. Let's see what people are actually whining about.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm in! Let's make this a breeze. I'll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the station block's meeting minutes. I want to see how the logistics actually play out.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"To ensure a fair distribution of the burden, I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk. We need a logical basis for any new arrangement.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited to find out what's happening next door! Maybe they have a secret trick to keep it smelling fresh. Do you think they use special bins? I bet it'll be like a treasure hunt!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a fun way to look at it, Rin! I hope you find some great ideas. I just want to make sure we have a clear picture of our budget before we decide.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"A treasure hunt for trash bins? How charming. While you're hunting for secrets, I'll be focusing on the actual grievances. It's better to know exactly where the friction is before we try to smooth it over.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Don't be such a killjoy, Shunichi! A little excitement makes the work go faster. I'm just curious if the timing is the real culprit here. If the trucks are erratic, no amount of ""smoothing"" will help.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Emotional excitement is irrelevant to the outcome. We should focus on the objective data. If we don't establish a fair standard for space and regulation now, we will only create new sources of conflict later.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Objective data is boring! I want to know if the people living there are happy. If we just follow rules but everyone still hates the smell, then we didn't really fix anything, right?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think both perspectives are important. We need the rules to be fair, but we also want a solution that makes everyone feel comfortable and happy in their own homes. Harmony is key here.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Harmony is a lovely sentiment, Midori, but it's usually just a mask for people who are too afraid to argue. Let's hope our ""objective data"" doesn't reveal that we all secretly despise each other.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"Now, now, let's not get all gloomy! A little tension just makes the resolution more satisfying. I'm sure we'll all be best friends once the trash is sorted. Right, Asuka?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Friendship is not the objective here. My only interest is ensuring that the final agreement is equitable and that no single household is unfairly burdened by the arrangement. Let us proceed to the findings.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready! I can't wait to see what I find out. I hope the other lane has something really cool that we can copy! Let's go see the results!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm ready too. I hope the financial information helps us find a sustainable way forward that doesn't put too much pressure on anyone. Let's see what we've all discovered!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's get this over with. I'm curious to see if the complaints are as predictable as I suspect. Let's see who actually has a point and who's just venting.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm all set! Let's see if the secrets I've uncovered can save us from a total disaster. Bring on the data—I'm dying to know if we're actually dealing with a logistics nightmare!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I am prepared. I expect the measurements and filing requirements to provide the necessary constraints for our discussion. Let us review the information and determine the most logical path forward.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
